;CASI-ADV-PLAN-STD;Advanced Ontology Service Plan - Standard (1 year);Monthly updates and next-business-day support for the Advanced Ontology.;"One year of monthly ontology updates, schema change notes, expert support by e-mail and phone with a next-business-day response, and two modelling workshops for your Advanced Ontology.";pieces;approved;casi-all,casi-services;4260000000059
